<h1>⚡ Nexus Bot Commands</h1>

<section>
<h2>⛊ Moderation</h2>
<p>
**n/kick @user <reason>** – Kick a member<br>
**n/ban @user <reason>** – Ban a member<br>
**n/unban <user_id>** – Unban a user<br>
**n/timeout @user <minutes> <reason>** – Timeout a member<br>
**n/removetimeout @user** – Remove a timeout<br>
**n/mute @user <reason>** – Mute a member<br>
**n/unmute @user** – Unmute a member<br>
**n/warn @user <reason>** – Warn a member<br>
**n/snipe [0-5] [#channel]** – Retrieve deleted messages<br>
**n/clear <amount> [ex:] [images/@user]** – Delete messages<br>
**n/setupapp #channel <title> - <question> | <question>** – Create an application form that sends responses to a specific channel<br>
**n/openapp [@user]** – Apply for a role or membership
</p>
</section>

<section>
<h2>⚙︎ Channel</h2>
<p>
**n/slowmode <seconds>** – Set slowmode delay<br>
**n/lock** – Lock current channel<br>
**n/unlock** – Unlock current channel
</p>
</section>

<section>
<h2>𐀪 Roles</h2>
<p>
**n/addrole @user @role** – Give a role<br>
**n/removerole @user @role** – Remove a role<br>
**n/rolecatalog** – View all roles
</p>
</section>

<section>
<h2>𝒊 Info</h2>
<p>
**n/userinfo @user** – Info about a user<br>
**n/serverinfo** – Info about the server<br>
**n/serverbanner** – Display server banner<br>
**n/avatar @user** – Member avatar<br>
**n/ping** – Show latency<br>
**n/time** – Show current UTC time<br>
**n/invite** – Get bot invite link
</p>
</section>

<section>
<h2>⚡︎ Utility</h2>
<p>
**n/say <message>** – Repeat a message<br>
**n/poll "question" <option1> <option2> [0d 0h]** – Start a poll<br>
**n/announce <message>** – Make an announcement<br>
**n/ask <question>** – Ask OpenAI<br>
**n/define <word>** – Look up a definition
</p>
</section>

<section>
<h2>☻ Fun & Games</h2>
<p>
**n/hug @user** – Hug someone<br>
**n/hugall** – Hug everyone<br>
**n/kiss @user** – Kiss someone<br>
**n/flipcoin** – Flip a coin<br>
**n/roll <sides>** – Roll dice<br>
**n/8ball <question>** – Magic 8ball<br>
**n/meme** – Get a meme<br>
**n/rps <rock/paper/scissors>** – Play Rock Paper Scissors<br>
**n/tictactoe @opponent** – Start Tic Tac Toe<br>
**n/tttmove <1-9>** – Choose a position<br>
**n/connect4 @opponent** – Start Connect 4<br>
**n/c4move <1-7>** – Pick a column<br>
**n/rpg** – Text RPG<br>
**n/spellduel @opponent** – Spell duel<br>
**n/rapbattle @opponent** – Rap battle<br>
**n/wordchain <word>** – Start word chain<br>
**n/endwordchain** – End word chain
</p>
</section>
